lot of the day finding someone to help them eat and "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["stuff."]},{"code":251,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"DailyBEmilia44","volume":100,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["…But Takiko getting Corrupt has made Saintil rethink how harsh they "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["were with Taka. Just a little bit. Nothing crazy. "]},{"code":251,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"DailyBEmilia45","volume":100,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I suppose some of you will see that as a win though, won’t you?"]},{"code":251,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"DailyBEmilia46","volume":100,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Well. I’m sure you’ll also be delighted to know that despite Ismene "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["being mostly preoccupied with Lyra, Takiko wasn’t entirely spared."]},{"code":251,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"DailyBEmilia47b","volume":100,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["It’s nowhere near as crazy as Ismene has gone with other prisoners, "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Dracul’s death and the incident with Prisoner 12 has dampened her a "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["little bit, but Takiko got that sweet-sweet lesson you wanted her to "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["get."]},{"code":251,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"DailyBEmilia48b","volume":100,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["A few times, Ismene left any food Takiko didn’t eat in Takiko’s empty "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["cell, believing Takiko hasn’t a right to be wasteful when she’s getting "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["help from others."]},{"code":251,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"DailyBEmilia49","volume":100,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["…Leaving Takiko to clean it all up before it rots."]},{"code":251,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"DailyBEmilia50","volume":100,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Which was pretty cruel, considering the Corrupt verdict made Takiko lose "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["almost all her appetite. So she’s not been eating a lot."]},{"code":251,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"DailyBEmilia51","volume":100,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["She’s become pretty withdrawn over all, I’m not certain she’s the biggest "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["fan of you anymore. She’s not too keen on being placed on the same level "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["as Lyra and Maiko. "]},{"code":251,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"DailyBEmilia52","volume":100,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["There hasn’t been any positive improvements in her behaviour, if you "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["were hoping to ‘teach her a lesson’ or whatever- I don’t know what you "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["were expecting. "]},{"code":251,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"DailyBEmilia53","volume":100,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["All she’s got is her views on the world confirmed, discarded by the other "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["prisoners now she’s no longer useful and an empty cell full of rotten food."]},{"code":251,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"DailyBEmilia54","volume":100,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Although, unlike Lyra, Ismene almost completely stopped harassing her "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["after the incident with Prisoner 12. "]},{"code":251,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"DailyBEmilia55","volume":100,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I keep alluding to that incident… How about we move onto it? Although, "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I’m sure you already guessed some of the details."]},{"code":251,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":235,"indent":0,"parameters":[10]},{"code":221,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[5,"EmiliaMolly",0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0]},{"code":222,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":230,"indent":0,"parameters":[100]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[10,"emilianametag",0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"DailyBEmilia56","volume":100,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Molly Yuzuki, who you judged as Corrupt by a whopping 78.5%-"]},{"code":251,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"DailyBEmilia57","volume":100,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["…Attempted suicide soon after her verdict."]},{"code":251,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"DailyBEmilia58","volume":100,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["She couldn’t handle living in a world where there was no chance her "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["precious Yui would ever forgive her… And I’m sure the bullying from "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Ismene didn’t help."]},{"code":251,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"DailyBEmilia59","volume":100,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["But, luckily… Or unluckily for you, she was saved."]},{"code":251,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"DailyBEmilia60","volume":100,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Alora stepped in and provided Molly with medical attention, keeping her "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["alive."]},{"code":251,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"DailyBEmilia61","volume":100,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Since then, a few policies have been put in place by Alora-"]},{"code":251,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"DailyBEmilia62","volume":100,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Everyone will continue to call her Maiko instead of Molly, as she "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["doesn’t want to be seen by her old name."]},{"code":251,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"DailyBEmilia63","volume":100,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["…And no one is allowed to mention Molly’s crime to her or discuss it, "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["everyone is to treat her with kindness and care until she’s ‘ready to "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["talk about it’ or whatever."]},{"code":251,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"DailyBEmilia64","volume":100,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Some Prisoners have gripes about how much this 28 year old is being coddled, "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["but I guess it’s better than her trying to off herself again."]},{"code":251,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"DailyBEmilia65","volume":100,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["It certainly made Ismene back off, she seems shaken by the incident-"]},{"code":251,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"DailyBEmilia66","volume":100,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["And one prisoner in particular has taken her under his wing, but I’m "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["sure you’ll see who exactly that is soon. "]},{"code":251,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"DailyBEmilia67","volume":100,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Either way, I think that catches you up on what you’ve missed. Things are "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["kinda going to shit, huh? It’s kinda fun in its own messed up way."]},{"code":251,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"DailyBEmilia68","volume":100,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Anyway, I’ll leave you to watch the stream now- it’s what you’re *really* "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["here for, right?"]},{"code":251,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"DailyBEmilia69","volume":100,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Although… Uh, if I could just say something-"]},{"code":251,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"DailyBEmilia70","volume":100,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Like, I know I told you all to be more harsh on the Prisoners last time… "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["But 3 Corrupts is pretty fucking harsh, huh?"]},{"code":251,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"DailyBEmilia71b","volume":100,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Now, like, I’m not against it… I just think it’s kiiiiiiiiiiinda curious "]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["how it’s the all-girls set of crimes that get the triple corrupt. Go figure."]},{"code":251,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"DailyBEmilia72b","volume":100,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Whatever, not like I care."]},{"code":251,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":250,"indent":0,"parameters":[{"name":"DailyBEmilia73b","volume":100,"pitch":100,"pan":0}]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Enjoy your stream, I’m sure I’ll see you soon."]},{"code":251,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":235,"indent":0,"parameters":[10]},{"code":230,"indent":0,"parameters":[60]},{"code":221,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":242,"indent":0,"parameters":[2]},{"code":235,"indent":0,"parameters":[5]},{"code":221,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[5,"LS32",0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0]},{"code":222,"indent":0,"parameter